  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Banning or kicking a user doesn't work when the user has mods bypassing the ban, since this ban is run purely on client side. This makes bans/kicks a useless feature.\nVRChat should use user-certificates to validate where a kick/ban/votekick is coming from and then disconnect a user on all clients (and server if possible) if the source is valid. So even when the banned client doesn't agree, all other clients should receive & validate the request and then disconnect that user if the source of that request is correct.\nIf a modded client refuses to execute the requested ban on their side, VRChat should further identify this client as malicious and ban the player from their game entirely. Bypassing moderation functions should not be tolerated.",
